  "DRS222Y5": "Students continue to build their foundational acting skills as they explore and apply approaches to heightened text, including Shakespeare and contemporary experimental drama.",
  "DRS321H5": "Vocal, Physical, and Interpretive Techniques for the developing actor become more specialized at this level. Elements of the course include stage combat, advanced vocal technique (including dialect and extreme performance demands), an introduction to on camera acting, and the pra…",
