  "LIN458H5": "All languages, in all linguistic domains, exhibit variation - more than one way of saying the same thing. This variation is not random but dependent on various linguistic, social, and cognitive conditioning factors.",
  "LIN460H5": "This course examines current issues of theoretical and/or empirical relevance in linguistics with special reference to phenomena involving language change.",
