  "POL407H5": "What can we learn about global politics from an oil or a mining contract? Who are the main actors in such contracts? What are key differences between oil and mining contracts? What is the future of oil and mining contracts? This course addresses these questions, by examining the…",
  "POL414H5": "This course is a critical study of the meaning and value of work in social and political life. Sources include both historical and contemporary political theories of work and labour.",
