  "WRI291H5": "This course provides an introduction to journalism and examines journalism’s role in a democratic society. Students learn the fundamentals of journalistic writing, with a focus on news and reporting.",
  "WRI292H5": "In this course, students design and carry out writing through a series of research techniques. Students learn to select and evaluate expert and scientific information from primary sources and produce content for an array of different media.",
  "WRI293H5": "Introduction to Technical Communication serves as an introduction to the academic and professional fields of technical writing and communication.",
